DESCRIPTION
Ensure loads and measurement CPUs are scheduled correctly via rteval.

STEPS TO RUN
MCPU=<measurement-cpulist> LCPU=<loads-cpulist> ./runtest.sh
By default MCPU=1, LCPU=2

SUPPORTED PLATFORMS
all

KNOWN ISSUES
RHEL-7: rteval-2.14* does not correctly schedule loads on the specified cpulist.
  Bug 1752512 - rteval can't enforce stress load on specified cpu list with --loads-cpulist
This was only fixed in RHEL-8.2:
  Bug 1724768 - rteval: adjust meaurement and loads modules to start on specified cpus
As such, this test case should only be run for RHEL-8.2+.
